      "heading": "What is IEC 60034-5?",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Part of the IEC 60034 series, IEC 60034-5 defines thermal insulation classes, temperature limits, and protection measures for electrical machines. Following this standard is crucial for safety, longevity, and regulatory approval."
