      "heading": "Key Features of IEC 60034-5",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "bullets": [
        "Insulation Classes: Defines A, B, F, H for safe operating temperatures.",
        "Temperature Limits: Specifies allowable temperature rises for stator, rotor, and bearings.",
        "Protection Measures: Guidelines against moisture, dust, and electrical overloads.",
        "Application Scope: Applies to AC & DC motors, generators, and industrial rotating machines."
      ],
