    {
      "heading": "IEC 60034-5 Implementation Guide",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "bullets": [
        "Identify the insulation class suitable for your application.",
        "Measure temperature rises during operation.",
        "Apply protective measures such as thermal sensors, enclosures, or overload protection.",
        "Document compliance for regulatory audits.",
        "Consult IEC 60034-1 and IEC 60034-30 for motor efficiency guidance."
